1669	/// parser records one `Err` per bad region and RESUMES at the next
1670	/// CRC-valid frame boundary; the `Err` keeps the file "unclean" so
1671	/// `prune_verified` retains it.  Frames whose framing is intact but
1672	/// whose payload fails to decode (lz4/json/op-mismatch) also record an
